# Results are evidence, not scratch. The brief asks that every claim about a
# result be connected to the evidence submitted, and a judge should be able to
# read the numbers without running anything first. So the headline artefacts are
# tracked, and only bulk is excluded.
results/**/rewards.jsonl
results/**/*.safetensors
results/**/checkpoints/
